{"54c024b4982b4074dbf5a5c88a86513da0e99b9825bb52febb2cd684eece220e": [{"text": " He also played non-league football for Grantham Town, Boston United, Shepshed Albion, Harworth Colliery Institute, Brigg Town, Armthorpe Welfare, Glapwell, Collingham (Notts) and Retford United.Grantham Town Football Club is a football club, based in Grantham, Lincolnshire, England.", "source": "halueval:knowledge"}], "f775ddd40cd9a030e3175e571b58d79ee33e3040be42e022535d6cd97bc2edb6": [{"text": " He also played non-league football for Grantham Town, Boston United, Shepshed Albion, Harworth Colliery Institute, Brigg Town, Armthorpe Welfare, Glapwell, Collingham (Notts) and Retford United.Grantham Town Football Club is a football club, based in Grantham, Lincolnshire, England.", "source": "halueval:knowledge"}], "6b12296f384bce088e85621b8c8c90f005d9afc36ece4641640dd518d5cc8b6c": [{"text": "Janggi (including romanizations changgi and jangki), sometimes called Korean chess, is a strategy board game popular in Korea. The game derived from xiangqi (Chinese chess) and is very similar to it, including the starting position of the pieces, and the 9\u00d710 gameboard, but without the xiangqi \"river\" dividing the board horizontally in the middle.Isola is a two-player abstract strategy board game. It is played on a 7x7 board which is initially filled with squares, except at the starting positions of the pieces.", "source": "halueval:knowledge"}], "794fc6ca8516fc6b663334c95aa463a2faf8643775980889fc0a78c36f869474": [{"text": "Janggi (including romanizations changgi and jangki), sometimes called Korean chess, is a strategy board game popular in Korea. The game derived from xiangqi (Chinese chess) and is very similar to it, including the starting position of the pieces, and the 9\u00d710 gameboard, but without the xiangqi \"river\" dividing the board horizontally in the middle.Isola is a two-player abstract strategy board game. It is played on a 7x7 board which is initially filled with squares, except at the starting positions of the pieces.", "source": "halueval:knowledge"}], "72521954e5a2361b38778234205b01c170dbaa8a0914cd4b06cebb1d78833930": [{"text": "Jang Hoon (born May 4, 1975) is a South Korean film director. It was selected as the South Korean entry for the Best Foreign Language Film at the 90th Academy Awards.", "source": "halueval:knowledge"}], "32b62a7d7d102b4746eb6fa7166ebcb6b240b692c1e0b57db7968656976f8360": [{"text": "Jang Hoon (born May 4, 1975) is a South Korean film director. It was selected as the South Korean entry for the Best Foreign Language Film at the 90th Academy Awards.", "source": "halueval:knowledge"}], "994ed0010d63117759b1fbd555ba7db255ecc5dd47e6ef048203ce59bd88b4fc": [{"text": "Mr. Wong, Detective is a 1938 American crime film directed by William Nigh and starring Boris Karloff in his first appearance as Mr. Wong.William Henry Pratt (23 November 1887 \u2013 2 February 1969), better known by his stage name Boris Karloff, was an English actor who was primarily known for his typecast roles in horror films that depicted the characters Frankenstein and the Mummy.", "source": "halueval:knowledge"}], "5ac564807f36d214c2cec3d47d5cf685510bebff39f78d84a2e888f8062615a4": [{"text": "Mr. Wong, Detective is a 1938 American crime film directed by William Nigh and starring Boris Karloff in his first appearance as Mr. Wong.William Henry Pratt (23 November 1887 \u2013 2 February 1969), better known by his stage name Boris Karloff, was an English actor who was primarily known for his typecast roles in horror films that depicted the characters Frankenstein and the Mummy.", "source": "halueval:knowledge"}], "cfc3bf4f4059d1f7e2d66396cf73353b4d638dceba9b4bbcdac521885835090c": [{"text": "The Many Adventures of Winnie the Pooh is a 1977 American animated film produced by Walt Disney Productions and distributed by Buena Vista Distribution.King of the Grizzlies is a 1970 American adventure film directed by Ron Kelly and written by Jack Speirs, Rod Peterson and Norman Wright.", "source": "halueval:knowledge"}], "5b678b13fa32d76ba5d9cc7fece86387acdffdb8b945bce8c7ebb4970a2b9522": [{"text": "The Many Adventures of Winnie the Pooh is a 1977 American animated film produced by Walt Disney Productions and distributed by Buena Vista Distribution.King of the Grizzlies is a 1970 American adventure film directed by Ron Kelly and written by Jack Speirs, Rod Peterson and Norman Wright.", "source": "halueval:knowledge"}], "cfdda10451e731ba74e0c70b4def1fdb7af1a7acc1f3d2ae3250ef9085eca664": [{"text": " The first series aired in April 2010, presented by Marco Pierre White.Marco Pierre White (born 11 December 1961) is a British chef, restaurateur, and television personality from Leeds.", "source": "halueval:knowledge"}], "3a9b818e379a3f2235e9993fc6c23e2b375a619c35ebd07c6b352a40df87b076": [{"text": " The first series aired in April 2010, presented by Marco Pierre White.Marco Pierre White (born 11 December 1961) is a British chef, restaurateur, and television personality from Leeds.", "source": "halueval:knowledge"}], "958115a38773af3c6ceef1aad7818430adb1cd6bb014adb019a1d87f6749ed48": [{"text": " Chetty represented South Africa at the 2008 Summer Olympics in Beijing, where she competed in two sabre events. It is one of the country's three capital cities, serving as the seat of the executive branch of government (Cape Town is the legislative capital and Bloemfontein the judicial capital).", "source": "halueval:knowledge"}], "84acfa0128d17bd1f2870acbdec3990b6b49a4c8ee1ea9512a6aaa79d5355bb7": [{"text": " Chetty represented South Africa at the 2008 Summer Olympics in Beijing, where she competed in two sabre events. It is one of the country's three capital cities, serving as the seat of the executive branch of government (Cape Town is the legislative capital and Bloemfontein the judicial capital).", "source": "halueval:knowledge"}], "a4c42d06758931091824f2d7f25c4e714294967941438898cd0f51a6b9ae49ab": [{"text": "KCFO (970 AM) is a Tulsa, Oklahoma, area Christian radio station. KCFO airs national shows such as Dave Ramsey, J. Vernon McGee, David Jeremiah, Dennis Rainey, and Albert Mohler.Richard Albert Mohler Jr. (born October 19, 1959), is an American historical theologian and the ninth president of the Southern Baptist Theological Seminary in Louisville, Kentucky. He has been described as \"one of America's most influential evangelicals\".", "source": "halueval:knowledge"}], "a896af3257afb973eeeffb30fd4298c5f112fb692fb81760e20e8c58fb78a2b2": [{"text": "KCFO (970 AM) is a Tulsa, Oklahoma, area Christian radio station. KCFO airs national shows such as Dave Ramsey, J. Vernon McGee, David Jeremiah, Dennis Rainey, and Albert Mohler.Richard Albert Mohler Jr. (born October 19, 1959), is an American historical theologian and the ninth president of the Southern Baptist Theological Seminary in Louisville, Kentucky. He has been described as \"one of America's most influential evangelicals\".", "source": "halueval:knowledge"}], "87f88209693a1f2eaf98bc4f9fa1f78eb1287539b1ea227d3b4ba0388ddb449b": [{"text": "NBA Access with Ahmad Rashad is an American television program which initially aired on Saturday afternoons on ABC.Ahmad Rash\u0101d (born Robert Earl Moore; November 19, 1949) is an American sportscaster (mostly with NBC Sports) and former professional football player.", "source": "halueval:knowledge"}], "9f04bf3637be76063a9167ec91f8180241abb853e40ed343e05df3160e49b9b6": [{"text": "NBA Access with Ahmad Rashad is an American television program which initially aired on Saturday afternoons on ABC.Ahmad Rash\u0101d (born Robert Earl Moore; November 19, 1949) is an American sportscaster (mostly with NBC Sports) and former professional football player.", "source": "halueval:knowledge"}], "4befc041ce0e65623bb59d868a6a2f7df39af969db0b6de3f933ba4996b0b145": [{"text": "Audre Lorde ( ; born Audrey Geraldine Lorde; February 18, 1934 \u2013 November 17, 1992) was a writer, feminist, womanist, librarian, and civil rights activist.David John Moore Cornwell (born 19 October 1931), known by the pseudonym John le Carr\u00e9 ( ), is a British author of espionage novels.", "source": "halueval:knowledge"}], "72c63477a0c5baf27ca9057318ab0bc6f5d983d850cfe2124d9e907fe095c33e": [{"text": "Audre Lorde ( ; born Audrey Geraldine Lorde; February 18, 1934 \u2013 November 17, 1992) was a writer, feminist, womanist, librarian, and civil rights activist.David John Moore Cornwell (born 19 October 1931), known by the pseudonym John le Carr\u00e9 ( ), is a British author of espionage novels.", "source": "halueval:knowledge"}], "112a96d1fcef8132e66d62dba7c419af4254e69797618cdaa54c5e6c2e9ced49": [{"text": " She is noted as a pioneer in the field of ecopsychology, a proponent of bioregional land-based culture, and a critic of technological society having worked with such contemporaries as Jerry Mander, Vandana Shiva, Stephanie Mills, and Kirkpatrick Sale.Vandana Shiva (Hindi: \u0935\u0902\u0926\u0928\u093e \u0936\u093f\u0935\u093e : born 5 November 1952) is an Indian scholar, environmental activist and anti-globalization author.", "source": "halueval:knowledge"}], "28d5b61cf3fd57f4cda8f2328712cc0072fbedc1c2b072666fe5bb8098d2fe8e": [{"text": " She is noted as a pioneer in the field of ecopsychology, a proponent of bioregional land-based culture, and a critic of technological society having worked with such contemporaries as Jerry Mander, Vandana Shiva, Stephanie Mills, and Kirkpatrick Sale.Vandana Shiva (Hindi: \u0935\u0902\u0926\u0928\u093e \u0936\u093f\u0935\u093e : born 5 November 1952) is an Indian scholar, environmental activist and anti-globalization author.", "source": "halueval:knowledge"}], "c3abea34c07312fda696463682445bdf12fbeba1e694095166dba056c7410ca1": [{"text": "Pie Five Pizza Co. is a fast casual restaurant chain specializing in handcrafted personal pizza made in less than 5 minutes. As of December 2016, Pie Five has 98 restaurants in the following locations: Alabama, Arkansas, Florida, Georgia, Illinois, Indiana, Kansas, Maryland, Minnesota, Missouri, Nebraska, North Carolina, Oklahoma, Tennessee, Texas, Utah, Kentucky, Virginia and Washington, D.C. with more than 400 additional company-owned and franchise units anticipated. It has 7 locations and is known for its Atlanta style pizza.", "source": "halueval:knowledge"}], "e0f4e0ec5ac1b7c623d061b3fbbcd6874abe3bfd064d402e96667279e7bf744e": [{"text": "Pie Five Pizza Co. is a fast casual restaurant chain specializing in handcrafted personal pizza made in less than 5 minutes. As of December 2016, Pie Five has 98 restaurants in the following locations: Alabama, Arkansas, Florida, Georgia, Illinois, Indiana, Kansas, Maryland, Minnesota, Missouri, Nebraska, North Carolina, Oklahoma, Tennessee, Texas, Utah, Kentucky, Virginia and Washington, D.C. with more than 400 additional company-owned and franchise units anticipated. It has 7 locations and is known for its Atlanta style pizza.", "source": "halueval:knowledge"}], "5a2808ce82c6c75c2450d0d36aa3bc75e39052597b9df2dfff9c553e7b1e0f4c": [{"text": " On April 11, 2013, US based Polaris Industries announced that it had acquired Aixam-Mega. Polaris is based in Roseau, Minnesota, USA.", "source": "halueval:knowledge"}], "3ec26a6553911e525ffe99706dfe13932e10b3e27f4ecf149ee424d715d38e79": [{"text": " On April 11, 2013, US based Polaris Industries announced that it had acquired Aixam-Mega. Polaris is based in Roseau, Minnesota, USA.", "source": "halueval:knowledge"}], "c1aac3f9733c5ed1d927432f610d3121dde8dde913272a9b8877993701fdcb59": [{"text": "Philip Bertie (c.1665 \u2013 15 April 1728) was an English courtier and politician, the third son of Robert Bertie, 3rd Earl of Lindsey.Robert Bertie, 3rd Earl of Lindsey PC FRS (8 November 1630 \u2013 8 May 1701), styled Lord Willoughby de Eresby from 1642 to 1666, was an English nobleman.", "source": "halueval:knowledge"}], "7c31e919b295f3d09e6a025818281738303dc29d7344faad78a5e3478b7845f9": [{"text": "Philip Bertie (c.1665 \u2013 15 April 1728) was an English courtier and politician, the third son of Robert Bertie, 3rd Earl of Lindsey.Robert Bertie, 3rd Earl of Lindsey PC FRS (8 November 1630 \u2013 8 May 1701), styled Lord Willoughby de Eresby from 1642 to 1666, was an English nobleman.", "source": "halueval:knowledge"}], "599039a35d44004c1a1d25513642bb8e0c2a873f7dd11e8985c3cc3101a19a84": [{"text": "Gustavo Nicol\u00e1s Aguirre (born March 31, 1988) is an Argentine professional basketball player. He currently plays for San Lorenzo of the Liga Nacional de B\u00e1squet.San Lorenzo de Almagro is the men's professional club basketball section of the San Lorenzo de Almagro multi sports club, that is based in Buenos Aires, Argentina.", "source": "halueval:knowledge"}], "ac464090c175651913cd692c7bc000a88d6fdcb0ccefc6c81abe17f644a4b3ff": [{"text": "Gustavo Nicol\u00e1s Aguirre (born March 31, 1988) is an Argentine professional basketball player. He currently plays for San Lorenzo of the Liga Nacional de B\u00e1squet.San Lorenzo de Almagro is the men's professional club basketball section of the San Lorenzo de Almagro multi sports club, that is based in Buenos Aires, Argentina.", "source": "halueval:knowledge"}], "8fc3c666d167cf2ea4ddc6725f297f0830088ce21b1c06eee280374a86328e1d": [{"text": "A Beta-3 adrenergic antagonist (\u03b2-adrenoceptor antagonist) is an adrenergic antagonist which blocks the Beta-3 adrenergic receptors of cells, with either high specificity (an antagonist which is selective for \u03b2 adrenoceptors) like L-748,328, L-748,337 and SR 59,230A or non-specifically (an antagonist for \u03b2 and for \u03b2 or \u03b2 adrenoceptors) like the non-selective betablocker Carvedilol.Carvedilol, sold under the brand name Coreg among others, is a beta blocker used for treating mild to severe congestive heart failure (CHF), left ventricular dysfunction (LVD) following heart attack in people who are otherwise stable, and for treating high blood pressure.", "source": "halueval:knowledge"}], "c3f95559a7c5f09e0b51963ea8dc98737bdebcc5c86676c38a85d9c998de3cc1": [{"text": "A Beta-3 adrenergic antagonist (\u03b2-adrenoceptor antagonist) is an adrenergic antagonist which blocks the Beta-3 adrenergic receptors of cells, with either high specificity (an antagonist which is selective for \u03b2 adrenoceptors) like L-748,328, L-748,337 and SR 59,230A or non-specifically (an antagonist for \u03b2 and for \u03b2 or \u03b2 adrenoceptors) like the non-selective betablocker Carvedilol.Carvedilol, sold under the brand name Coreg among others, is a beta blocker used for treating mild to severe congestive heart failure (CHF), left ventricular dysfunction (LVD) following heart attack in people who are otherwise stable, and for treating high blood pressure.", "source": "halueval:knowledge"}], "a44936581a8bd0c93a8a19db1b1674b51170b2890cd89257dd74484fbf57b9b1": [{"text": "Constance \"Connie\" Ray (born July 10, 1956) is an American film and television actress and playwright. Among her highest profile appearances are \"Thank You for Smoking\" (2006) and \"Stuart Little\" (1999), and the television drama \"ER\" (1997). She also appeared in \"Ice Princess\" (2005) and on \"George Lopez\" (2002).Ice Princess is a 2005 American figure-skating film directed by Tim Fywell, written by Hadley Davis from a story by Meg Cabot and Davis, and starring Michelle Trachtenberg, Joan Cusack, Kim Cattrall and Hayden Panettiere.", "source": "halueval:knowledge"}], "3d29f3f065c3ebf4b2f4c0284690bfa86d658b733595c5e113c9fd4d22dc9dca": [{"text": "Constance \"Connie\" Ray (born July 10, 1956) is an American film and television actress and playwright. Among her highest profile appearances are \"Thank You for Smoking\" (2006) and \"Stuart Little\" (1999), and the television drama \"ER\" (1997). She also appeared in \"Ice Princess\" (2005) and on \"George Lopez\" (2002).Ice Princess is a 2005 American figure-skating film directed by Tim Fywell, written by Hadley Davis from a story by Meg Cabot and Davis, and starring Michelle Trachtenberg, Joan Cusack, Kim Cattrall and Hayden Panettiere.", "source": "halueval:knowledge"}], "0252bdae51fe11606148a1666edbe87029a2036ee316993c748bcd0cf7c52e33": [{"text": " He has appeared in films such as \"Cold Mountain\", \"Nil By Mouth\", \"King Arthur\", \"The Magic Roundabout\", \"The Departed\", \"Beowulf\", \"Indiana Jones and the Kingdom of the Crystal Skull\", \"Edge of Darkness\", \"The Sweeney\" and \"Noah\".The Magic Roundabout (released in France as Pollux - Le man\u00e8ge enchant\u00e9 and redubbed in the United States as Doogal or The Lord of the Springs) is a 2005 French-British computer-animated adventure fantasy film based on the television series \"The Magic Roundabout\".", "source": "halueval:knowledge"}], "4d0cdce2eb9fb1fa6cb42f71961c7b29aa41ee2ed2312571452c800e051f0b69": [{"text": " He has appeared in films such as \"Cold Mountain\", \"Nil By Mouth\", \"King Arthur\", \"The Magic Roundabout\", \"The Departed\", \"Beowulf\", \"Indiana Jones and the Kingdom of the Crystal Skull\", \"Edge of Darkness\", \"The Sweeney\" and \"Noah\".The Magic Roundabout (released in France as Pollux - Le man\u00e8ge enchant\u00e9 and redubbed in the United States as Doogal or The Lord of the Springs) is a 2005 French-British computer-animated adventure fantasy film based on the television series \"The Magic Roundabout\".", "source": "halueval:knowledge"}], "e624d7e12be742b067c752f6bcaf6c42a0152c0d43c35a366f23752417624b51": [{"text": "Millet is a French-based company specializing in outdoor equipment such as backpacks and sleeping bags, owned by Lafuma.Timberland LLC is an American manufacturer and retailer of outdoors wear, with a focus on footwear.", "source": "halueval:knowledge"}], "9356ad45e0b7be1823c1820ba1ebd8524bca99d7b9322154069a024af853991f": [{"text": "Millet is a French-based company specializing in outdoor equipment such as backpacks and sleeping bags, owned by Lafuma.Timberland LLC is an American manufacturer and retailer of outdoors wear, with a focus on footwear.", "source": "halueval:knowledge"}], "9eb572334bb0519edc0a255d1174c43e262a96a76b3a8051c77542823194efed": [{"text": "Alan Merrill (born Allan Preston Sachs; February 19, 1951) is an American vocalist, guitarist, songwriter, actor and model. He is the lead singer of the first ever released version and co-author of the song \"I Love Rock 'n' Roll\" by the Arrows in 1975.\"I Love Rock 'n' Roll\" is a rock song written in 1975 by Alan Merrill of the Arrows, who recorded the first released version. The song was later made famous by Joan Jett & the Blackhearts in 1982.", "source": "halueval:knowledge"}], "9128e0a3d7dd3b2e133a40b327fed75288e6efe71bdc68c736d217b366f8ddc9": [{"text": "Alan Merrill (born Allan Preston Sachs; February 19, 1951) is an American vocalist, guitarist, songwriter, actor and model. He is the lead singer of the first ever released version and co-author of the song \"I Love Rock 'n' Roll\" by the Arrows in 1975.\"I Love Rock 'n' Roll\" is a rock song written in 1975 by Alan Merrill of the Arrows, who recorded the first released version. The song was later made famous by Joan Jett & the Blackhearts in 1982.", "source": "halueval:knowledge"}], "66a7a15c0666504d61616be637a155cd2f1e4a8c4b5b06ebe593a1c792fea3eb": [{"text": "Serge de Poligny (1903\u20131983) was a French screenwriter and film director.Ric Viers (born 1973) is an American sound effects producer. He has also worked as a sound designer, film director, screenwriter, and author.", "source": "halueval:knowledge"}], "bc7de9dc208306b835b526f830d73f19388651d817ac649bb40e6b2a6a3f286a": [{"text": "Serge de Poligny (1903\u20131983) was a French screenwriter and film director.Ric Viers (born 1973) is an American sound effects producer. He has also worked as a sound designer, film director, screenwriter, and author.", "source": "halueval:knowledge"}], "4d42d4c4d4b5a2eb8cfeefd1f461504c94161a232cf63d81a2eb6da8996a27ec": [{"text": "Star Wars: Episode I \u2013 The Phantom Menace is a 1999 American epic space opera film written and directed by George Lucas, produced by Lucasfilm and distributed by 20th Century Fox. It is the first installment in the \"Star Wars\" prequel trilogy and stars Liam Neeson, Ewan McGregor, Natalie Portman, Jake Lloyd, Ian McDiarmid, Anthony Daniels, Kenny Baker, Ahmed Best, Pernilla August, Brian Blessed, Ray Park, and Frank Oz.Ian McDiarmid ( ; born 11 August 1944) is an Olivier and Tony award-winning Scottish character actor and director. He has appeared in 47 films since 1976.", "source": "halueval:knowledge"}], "c87bf27458eda12c926d0c3e30508024e7a56ddfb1ee3b6b79d4b223a6528f69": [{"text": "Star Wars: Episode I \u2013 The Phantom Menace is a 1999 American epic space opera film written and directed by George Lucas, produced by Lucasfilm and distributed by 20th Century Fox. It is the first installment in the \"Star Wars\" prequel trilogy and stars Liam Neeson, Ewan McGregor, Natalie Portman, Jake Lloyd, Ian McDiarmid, Anthony Daniels, Kenny Baker, Ahmed Best, Pernilla August, Brian Blessed, Ray Park, and Frank Oz.Ian McDiarmid ( ; born 11 August 1944) is an Olivier and Tony award-winning Scottish character actor and director. He has appeared in 47 films since 1976.", "source": "halueval:knowledge"}], "c069503098d3c18afd1a581a63eeb8eb30f4dc5ce8d0286c0acfb326b542a387": [{"text": "Robert Lepage, {'1': \", '2': \", '3': \", '4': \"} (born December 12, 1957) is a French Canadian playwright, actor, film director, and stage director, one of Canada's most honoured theatre artists. Thereafter Genet was raised in the provincial town of Alligny-en-Morvan, in the Ni\u00e8vre department of central France.", "source": "halueval:knowledge"}], "f61d0f004e5c9130a05414272aefc3136c06b0159c595ab558d6de5791ef0de8": [{"text": "Robert Lepage, {'1': \", '2': \", '3': \", '4': \"} (born December 12, 1957) is a French Canadian playwright, actor, film director, and stage director, one of Canada's most honoured theatre artists. Thereafter Genet was raised in the provincial town of Alligny-en-Morvan, in the Ni\u00e8vre department of central France.", "source": "halueval:knowledge"}], "f5d111b59be4c744641e0e5d73c8ffc37144659e043cbfeb8c10a631075f1e6c": [{"text": "Michele Landis Dauber is an American lawyer, a leading figure focusing in constitutional history and law, distributive justice, federalism, gender & sexual orientation discrimination, inequality, law & society, public policy & empirical studies, torts and welfare & poverty law, currently the Frederick I. Richman Professor at Stanford Law School.People v. Turner, formally People of the State of California v. Brock Allen Turner (2015), was a criminal case filed in Santa Clara County Superior Court which convicted Brock Allen Turner of three counts of felony sexual assault.", "source": "halueval:knowledge"}], "c07066b4bc09c640d81b0cccaff515922efe85104512ff160c424a570ae5babe": [{"text": "Michele Landis Dauber is an American lawyer, a leading figure focusing in constitutional history and law, distributive justice, federalism, gender & sexual orientation discrimination, inequality, law & society, public policy & empirical studies, torts and welfare & poverty law, currently the Frederick I. Richman Professor at Stanford Law School.People v. Turner, formally People of the State of California v. Brock Allen Turner (2015), was a criminal case filed in Santa Clara County Superior Court which convicted Brock Allen Turner of three counts of felony sexual assault.", "source": "halueval:knowledge"}], "ab430c5a3a234a57fb6ca1c5b072198dc3e71b7b6d7a9998033ed356619f57ff": [{"text": " The film stars Nicolas Cage, Sarah Wayne Callies, Veronica Ferres, Lauren Beatty, Jack Fulton, and Elizabeth Jeanne le Roux.Sarah Wayne Callies (born June 1, 1977) is an American actress. She is best known for her portrayals of Sara Tancredi in Fox's \"Prison Break\", Lori Grimes in AMC's \"The Walking Dead\" and Katie Bowman in USA Network's \"Colony\".", "source": "halueval:knowledge"}], "be67a17ae5c24886cb2599472b587f89fc992708472a7af67f25473012494dea": [{"text": " The film stars Nicolas Cage, Sarah Wayne Callies, Veronica Ferres, Lauren Beatty, Jack Fulton, and Elizabeth Jeanne le Roux.Sarah Wayne Callies (born June 1, 1977) is an American actress. She is best known for her portrayals of Sara Tancredi in Fox's \"Prison Break\", Lori Grimes in AMC's \"The Walking Dead\" and Katie Bowman in USA Network's \"Colony\".", "source": "halueval:knowledge"}], "77f2d7da8f37a6a2dbbe8f1eb818290c4693c319611ad3744cf5d118cf6cce1a": [{"text": "Across the Bridge of Hope is a compilation album created and recorded in support of victims of the Omagh bombings, by Tim Hegarty and Ross Graham.The Omagh bombing was a car bombing that took place on 15 August 1998 in Omagh, County Tyrone, Northern Ireland.", "source": "halueval:knowledge"}], "6ebfd11c8e4849fea1a379374bb30d9934df9e29c46810ba4fbf0b8d18f8ebdd": [{"text": "Across the Bridge of Hope is a compilation album created and recorded in support of victims of the Omagh bombings, by Tim Hegarty and Ross Graham.The Omagh bombing was a car bombing that took place on 15 August 1998 in Omagh, County Tyrone, Northern Ireland.", "source": "halueval:knowledge"}], "90f47ddf9a3dddc2f126be7b499965ed7e18d97e806a36b5e594ffbaced3fefa": [{"text": " The idea was initiated in 1898 by Sir Ebenezer Howard in the United Kingdom.Sir Ebenezer Howard {'1': \", '2': \", '3': \", '4': \"} ( ; 29 January 1850 \u2013 1 May 1928), the English founder of the garden city movement, is known for his publication \"\" (1898), the description of a utopian city in which people live harmoniously together with nature.", "source": "halueval:knowledge"}], "83aa686907e3471c126d593c1bf70cf3281414c6624a1aacb4fd64e9ecebf793": [{"text": " The idea was initiated in 1898 by Sir Ebenezer Howard in the United Kingdom.Sir Ebenezer Howard {'1': \", '2': \", '3': \", '4': \"} ( ; 29 January 1850 \u2013 1 May 1928), the English founder of the garden city movement, is known for his publication \"\" (1898), the description of a utopian city in which people live harmoniously together with nature.", "source": "halueval:knowledge"}], "268a404f585f8bd013b71e51d62646056a9bc7c8a4f56d46e4e9a209b1eb4f9f": [{"text": "Craig Serling is an American film director, film producer, screenwriter, and television editor known for multiple Primetime Emmy nominations for 'Outstanding Picture Editing for Non-Fiction Programming' and for his 2006 directorial debut feature film \"Jam\".Jeff Celentano (born May 24, 1960), also credited as Jeff Weston, is an American actor, screenwriter, and director.", "source": "halueval:knowledge"}], "d4278faf5bdc60a6893e682203c3e160152a0703785f12053c0238b977c40ad2": [{"text": "Craig Serling is an American film director, film producer, screenwriter, and television editor known for multiple Primetime Emmy nominations for 'Outstanding Picture Editing for Non-Fiction Programming' and for his 2006 directorial debut feature film \"Jam\".Jeff Celentano (born May 24, 1960), also credited as Jeff Weston, is an American actor, screenwriter, and director.", "source": "halueval:knowledge"}]}